                    <death when="1848-02-09"/>
                    <occupation>Poet </occupation>
                    <note type="editorial">
                        <p>Godwin notes meeting her on one occasion in relation to Wollstonecraft.  He also met her mother <persName key="CHR06">Elizabeth</persName>
and her brother <persName key="CRI02">Joshua</persName>. Anne's poetry was published by Joseph Johnson and there is evidence of her acquaintance with that circle. The entries to 'Cristal' may be to Anne rather than her brother - but they
have been coded as distinguishing her brother.  There are connections in addition with Mary Hays for both.  </p>
                    </note>
                    <bibl type="printedbook">Janet Todd, <title>The Collected Lettters of Mary Wollstonecraft</title> Columbia N.Y., 2003.</bibl>
